<p>President Trump said &quot;Cuba is next&quot; during a speech in Miami on Friday, where he praised what he called recent US military successes in Venezuela and Iran. Coverage differed on how to interpret the remark. Al Jazeera framed it as a direct threat of military attack, while other outlets emphasized that Trump did not spell out any specific next step toward Cuba.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/z8R4Pv2pnh9FS1AeCSi_CWDiVveV9tNtn2-Lguyv575nzdZHBY6uIidkluyUbEU10ikSoDUe-WdAyJf_0qAADRjY8cI4eFW-Fu4Nr67WNJCA2BsMFi2Q8kAwzTZA_RxnRVCn2n_OJXWxJ6JLRyMUsWLiXkjR-GfdKSax2nMtyZPc81DKJ6FHKPAtSuFQgPatzDdyO96CNNFC8-WCCU23gRaTh-OGoSMuLz8CbqL7yvJX-SfLH8joX6E' alt='President Trump speaks during an event in Miami tied to the Cuba remarks.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>NDTV and The Hindu said the appearance was an investment forum, not a formal policy address.</li><li>NDTV’s headline set the remark &quot;amid Iran war,&quot; underscoring the wider moment of US military confrontation around the speech.</li><li>The Hindu linked the comment to Cuba’s deep economic crisis and to President Trump’s repeated claim that Havana’s government is close to collapse.</li><li>The Straits Times reported that the administration had opened negotiations in recent weeks with elements of Cuba’s leadership, a sharp contrast with the speech.</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/amid-iran-war-donald-trump-says-cuba-is-next-11277008#publisher=newsstand'>Amid Iran War, Trump Says &quot;Cuba Is Next&quot;</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-says-cuba-is-next-in-speech-touting-us-military-successes/article70795408.ece'>Trump says ‘Cuba is next’ in speech touting U.S. military successes</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/3/28/trump-says-cuba-is-next-target-of-us-military'>Trump says ‘Cuba is next’ target of US military</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www